msgstr "Akkaawuntiin kee {source} irraa as fidame. Achitti haqtee hanga fixtutti, ergaawwan fi beeksisawwan sarvara lamaaniyyuu ga'uu danda'u, qabeenyi kee tokko tokko sarvaraa durii irraa tajaajilamu itti fufa, fi hordoftonni si argachuu dhaaf daqiiqaawwan muraasa fudhachuu danda'u."

#: src/features/user/close-account.tsx:121
msgid "Your account will be permanently deleted on {purgeDate}. You've been signed out. To cancel, sign in again before then."
msgstr "Akkaawuntiin kee guyyaa {purgeDate} bara baraan ni haqama. Ati ala baata. Haquuf, guyyaa sana dura irra deebi'ii seeni."

#: src/features/user/close-account.tsx:89
msgid "Your account will be scheduled for deletion and you'll be signed out. You can cancel any time before the deletion date by logging back in. Download your data first if you want to keep a copy."
msgstr "Akaawuntiin kee haquuf ni qophaaʼa, atis ni baata. Guyyaa haqiinsaa dura yeroo barbaaddetti deebitee seenuun dhaabuu dandeessa. Garagalcha tursiisuu yoo barbaadde, duraan daataa kee buusi."

#: src/features/user/data.tsx:171
msgid "Your data"
msgstr "Daataa kee"

#: src/features/user/data.tsx:113
msgid "Your data is downloading"
msgstr "Deetaan kee gadi buufamaa jira"

#: src/features/user/data.tsx:153
msgid "Your private keys are included, encrypted with this passphrase. Store it safely. You'll need it to restore."
msgstr "Furtuu dhuunfaa kee ni hammatama, jecha darbii kanaatiin faayduu. Iddoo nagahaa keessa kuusi. Deebisuuf isatti ni barbaadda."
